  "body": "Looking for a home that combines modern comfort, outdoor space and effortless living? This beautifully designed, brand-new home in Strathmill, Orewa, offers style, practicality and a relaxed, low-maintenance lifestyle. Set on a 279m² (more or less) section, the spacious deck and private garden provide the perfect setting for entertaining, family time or simply unwinding outdoors. With direct deck access from both the living area and master bedroom, plus an easy-care design that’s ideal for locking up and leaving, this home is perfect for first-home buyers, downsizers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nFeatures You Will Love:\r\n\r\n•  3 well-proportioned bedrooms and 2 stylish bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n•  Light-filled open-plan living and dining with a welcoming feel\r\n•  Contemporary wraparound kitchen with quality appliances, generous bench space and excellent storage\r\n•  Sliding doors from both the living area and master bedroom opening directly onto the  expansive deck\r\n•  Generous private garden with room for kids to play, summer BBQs and outdoor entertaining\r\n•  Sun tunnels in both bathrooms bringing in additional natural light\r\n•  Master bedroom featuring its own ensuite and ample wardrobe space\r\n•  Durable brick and weatherboard construction with modern street appeal\r\n•  Heat pump for year-round comfort\r\n•  Single internal-access garage plus additional off-street parking\r\n•  Pre-wiring for future EV charger installation\r\n•  Easy-care, low-maintenance design – perfect for a lock-up-and-leave lifestyle\r\n•  Handy to Orewa Beach, schools, shops and cafés\r\n\r\nOne Community. Multiple Homes. One Easy Tour!\r\n\r\nWhy visit one home when you can explore several?\r\n\r\nWe have a great selection of brand-new homes throughout Strathmill, offering different layouts, sizes and features to suit your lifestyle and budget.\r\n\r\nCall Brianna and Brian to book your personalised Strathmill Home Tour – compare multiple homes in one convenient visit!\r\n\r\nViewing Directions: Via Flavell Road, or GPS to 251 West Hoe Heights, Orewa. Follow the Strathmill signs.",
